Package: nux-launcher
Version: 1.0.0
Section: games
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: Antigravity Engineering <alz@debian.local>
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), libgtk-4-1 (>= 4.12.0), default-jre | openjdk-17-jre | openjdk-21-jre
Description: NUX Launcher Linux - Personal Edition
 High-performance native Rust Minecraft launcher optimized for Debian Linux.
 Features official Mojang manifest integration, Fabric, Sodium, Iris,
 Modrinth mod search, and Microsoft OAuth 2.0 Device Code authentication.
